        "groups, we treat a join input to be broadcasted as a dimension input and treat a join " +
        "input to be shuffled as a fact input, and then puts a fact input with all its " +
        "corresponding filtered dimension input into the same join group.")
      .booleanConf
      .createWithDefault(true)

