            "The parameters should be provided as a comma separated key=value pairs."
          )
          .createWithDefault(Seq())

      val DYNAMIC_PRUNING_FILTERS_COST_BASED_DECISION_MULTIPLIER =
        buildConf("spark.databricks.optimizer.dynamicPruning.costBasedDecision.multiplier")
          .doc("A multiplier applied to the cost with dynamic filter before comparing with the" +
            " cost without dynamic filter. If this value is set to -1.0, dynamic filter wins " +
