           "`io.parquet.vectorized.nativeFrameReader.taskSamplePercent` or " +
           "`io.parquet.rowBased.nativeFrameReader.taskSamplePercent` are set to positive values.")
      .booleanConf
      .createWithDefault(true)

  val PHOTON_NATIVE_FRAME_READER_ENABLED =
    buildConf("spark.databricks.io.parquet.photon.nativeFrameReader.enabled")
      .internal()
      .owner("eng-storage-io")
      .doc("Enables the parquet::FrameReader, replacing the original Photon Parquet Reader.")
      .booleanConf
      .createWithDefault(true)

  val PHOTON_NATIVE_FRAME_READER_RATE =
    buildConf("spark.databricks.io.parquet.photon.nativeFrameReader.taskSamplePercent")
      .internal()
      .owner("eng-storage-io")
      .doc("The sample rate for the Photon Native Parquet Frame Reader. This conf has effect " +
           "only if `io.parquet.photon.nativeFrameReader.enabled` is true. The sample rate is " +
           "per task, and the selection is deterministic based on taskId and stageId. Sampling " +
           "is only done on the first attempt of a task. This is not done if we are not in task " +
           "context.")
      .intConf
      .checkValue(v => v >= 0 && v <= 100 || v == 200, "The value must be between 0 and 100, or " +
                  "exactly 200. 200 always enables the feature, i.e. disables fallbacks in task " +
                  "retries.")
      .createWithDefault(200)

  val VECTORIZED_NATIVE_FRAME_READER_RATE =
    buildConf("spark.databricks.io.parquet.vectorized.nativeFrameReader.taskSamplePercent")
      .internal()
      .owner("eng-storage-io")
      .doc("The sample rate for the native parquet frame reader with vectorized decoder. " +
           "This conf has effect only if `io.parquet.nativeFrameReader.enabled` is true. " +
           "The sample rate is per task, and the selection is deterministic based on " +
           "taskId and stageId. Sampling is only done on the first attempt of a task. This is " +
           "not done if we are not in task context. If inside tests, the value is always 100.")
      .intConf
      .checkValue(v => v >= 0 && v <= 100, "The value must be between 0 and 100.")
      .createWithDefault(if (Utils.isTesting || DatabricksEdgeConfigs.classicSqlEnabled) 100 else 0)

  val ROW_BASED_NATIVE_FRAME_READER_RATE =
    buildConf("spark.databricks.io.parquet.rowBased.nativeFrameReader.taskSamplePercent")
      .internal()
      .owner("eng-storage-io")
      .doc("The sample rate for the native parquet frame reader with row-based decoder. " +
           "This conf has effect only if `io.parquet.nativeFrameReader.enabled` is true. " +
           "The sample rate is per task, and the selection is deterministic based on " +
           "taskId and stageId. Sampling is only done on the first attempt of a task. This is " +
           "not done if we are not in task context. If inside tests, the value is always 100.")
      .intConf
      .checkValue(v => v >= 0 && v <= 100, "The value must be between 0 and 100.")
      .createWithDefault(if (Utils.isTesting || DatabricksEdgeConfigs.classicSqlEnabled) 100 else 0)

