  // Set the default to the latest release with the following format:
  // _ . _(1 decimal place) ___(3 decimal places) __ (2 decimal places)
  // ^   ^                  ^                     ^
  // |   minor release      maintenance release   category of H3 expression (defined below)
  // major release
  // H3 expressions fall into three categories, in increasing order of memory management risk.
  // - Category 1: Expressions that don't need additional working memory.
  // - Category 2: Expressions that need dynamically allocated working memory that is tracked.
  // - Category 3: Expressions that need dynamically allocated working memory that is untracked,
  //               e.g. polyfill-related expressions.
  // For example, a category 2 expression Photonized in 11.3.1 would have a release of 11.300102.
  // Note that the default flag value should be updated whenever new H3 expressions are Photonized.
  val GEO_H3_PHOTON_RELEASE =
    buildConf("spark.databricks.geo.h3.photon.release")
      .internal()
      .doc("The latest release to enable Photon support for H3 APIs")
      .doubleConf
      .createWithDefault(14.200001)

