      .internal()
      .doc(
        "When enabled, automatically detects and rewrites SQL range conditions expressed as " +
        "compound boolean expressions into optimized BETWEEN variants. Specifically converts: " +
        "(1) 'A <= Col && Col <= B' to 'Col BETWEEN A AND B' for closed intervals, " +
        "(2) 'A < Col && Col <= B' to 'Col BETWEEN_L_OPEN A AND B' for left-open intervals, " +
        "(3) 'A <= Col && Col < B' to 'Col BETWEEN_R_OPEN A AND B' for right-open intervals, " +
        "and (4) 'A < Col && Col < B' to 'Col BETWEEN_OPEN A AND B' for open intervals. " +
        "The rewrite preserves semantic equivalence while potentially reducing expression " +
        "evaluation overhead during query execution. This is a Photon-only optimization"
      )
