  val CLOUD_FILES_RECTIFY_SCHEMA_EVOLUTION =
    buildConf("spark.databricks.cloudFiles.schemaEvolution.rectifyWithFileOrRecordSchema")
      .internal()
      .doc(
        s"""When enabled, if AutoLoader found that an evolved schema has not included the fields
           |that caused the UnknownFieldException, it will attempt to directly leverage the fields
           |from the UnknownFieldException and merge them into the schema to prevent schema
           |evolution from being stuck.
           |This could happen either 1) the schema of a batch of files is inferred differently
           |from the individual schema of the files during schema evolution, or 2) the schema
           |inference completely failed during schema evolution.
