        "   | generate stats. The supported policies are LRU, SLRU, and S3Fifo. Since shadow " +
        "   | policies add overhead to each cache operation, it is recommended to limit their " +
        "   | number to two. In case the the provided string does not parse, we revert to just " +
        "   | the LRU policy without shadow policies.")
